        "Control three budgets separately: the studio fee, the FF&E budget and the building works budget.",
        "Written sign-offs at the end of each phase and a priced change log protect the client's budget and the studio's fee.",
        "Track hours against fee by phase; it is the quickest way to see whether a fixed-fee project is still profitable.",
